{"text":"太（大）魏武泰元年四月戊子朔六日癸巳，景隆寺沙門曇念仰爲一切衆生，敬造彌勒像一區。又願彌勒三會□□□□聞佛法，悟無生忍，共成正覺。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"景隆寺","refId":null,"text":"景隆寺","start":19,"end":22},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"沙門","refId":null,"text":"沙門","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"PersonName","term":"曇念","refId":null,"text":"曇念","start":24,"end":26},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":30,"end":32},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":43,"end":45},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":45,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無生法忍","refId":null,"text":"無生","start":56,"end":58},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":62,"end":64}]}